Notes:
	AlexAligned Unified v7 split, part C, engine free columns, returns momentum breadth rotation. Run FIRST with import apply scan, it creates the shared data file.
	Generated from the v6 script by gen_AlexAligned_Unified_v7_split.py. Every v6 scan column is in exactly one part.
	Parts A B C and D share ONE data file, alexaligned_unified_v7.rtd, written by the import in part C.
	Merge the scan CSVs with merge_v7_scans.py before the terminal Update.
	The Import block below is identical in all parts and only runs when import is on the command line, so only part C is run with import.

